1
00:00:02,150 --> 00:00:08,620
Bangkok. Live music all night. Almost none of it paid for.

2
00:00:09,270 --> 00:00:21,020
16,000 THB/year. Same bill on a packed Saturday as an empty Tuesday.

3
00:00:21,870 --> 00:00:38,900
No log, no proof. 40 requests a night = ~2,640 THB/month to the venue.

4
00:00:40,150 --> 00:00:52,380
Blanket fees. No play-level proof. Artists get nothing per play.

5
00:00:54,030 --> 00:00:56,420
PerPlay — every play pays.

6
00:00:57,170 --> 00:01:04,120
One tap. One QR. ฿30.

7
00:01:04,870 --> 00:01:17,580
Real PromptPay payload. Bank capture simulated.

8
00:01:18,230 --> 00:01:24,220
Licensed · paid · anchoring on-chain.

9
00:01:25,270 --> 00:01:38,620
70 / 10 / 20 · three real BSC transactions · 22.4 s

10
00:01:39,370 --> 00:01:47,760
One ledger. Both sides.

11
00:01:48,410 --> 00:01:59,920
No bond, no business. HTTP 402.

12
00:02:00,670 --> 00:02:06,900
Only tonight's setlist clears. HTTP 409.

13
00:02:07,550 --> 00:02:30,260
$PLAY — pair with the stablecoin, stake, earn yield paid as royalty credits.

14
00:02:32,510 --> 00:02:52,780
One play. One on-chain license.
